  targetName: ESKA MARROW
  alias: THE DANGEROUS AND SYMPATHETIC
  species: Threl
  issuingFactionId: guild
  charges: Murder. Dead or alive.
  whoTheyActuallyAre: 'She killed the man who took her brother''s contract off the
    board and delivered him. She has been hunting bounty hunters for two years. She
    has killed four. Approach: Her walls are covered in contracts. One of them is
    Carver''s, annotated, in her handwriting, current to last month.


    When beaten:
    "You''ve done it more than I have. You''ve done it hundreds of times, and they
    call me the murderer."'
